n (Raid) [quest=3012]\n- The Mastery of Corruption (Raid) [quest=3008]\n- The Mastery of Endurance (Raid) [quest=2997]\n- The Mastery of Foresight (Raid) [quest=3014]\n- The Mastery of Hate (Raid) [quest=3006]\n- The Mastery of Specialization (Raid) [quest=3010]\n**Era:** | !Omens of War\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Monk\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 15 16:58:12 2005\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **If you have the Fistwraps of Celestial Discipline (monk epic 1.5):**\n_Kaiaren spawns on the aviak island in the Ocean of Tears at +1290, +3995 post-revamp._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kaiaren'\nKaiaren says 'Hello \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, I have been [expecting] you.'\nYou say, 'Why have you been expecting me?'\nKaiaren says 'There is still much that needs to be done and I lack the strength still to continue it myself. If you choose to you can first begin by completing a [simple task] for me.'\nYou say, 'What simple task?'\nKaiaren says 'I need you to gather some rare [delicacies] and bring them back to me. This meal has been passed down the Order for ages. This meal is said to grant strength back to the feeble. It is the only way possible for us to combat this [menace].'\nYou say, 'What delicacies?'\nKaiaren says 'I will need to you to gather some [sunless nectar] and some meat from an [ancient creature].'\nYou say, 'What sunless nectar?'\nKaiaren says 'The sunless nectar comes from the darkest parts of Norrath. Once you find it you must combine it with some spices and a pie tin to make a Sugar and Spice Nectar Pie. Please return soon after you have both items.'\nYou say, 'What ancient creature?'\nKaiaren says 'The creature you seek has been living for as long as any can remember. It can be found surrounded by water. You will need to take its meat and combine it with grilling sauce, a loaf of bread, and some cheese to make a Grilled Aged Meat and Cheese Sandwich. Please return soon after you have both items.'\nYou say, 'What menace?'\nKaiaren says 'What menace? For sure Vortix has mentioned to you his dreams? His dreams provide a rare gift of foresight into what lies ahead. There is a dark threat that looms over the Order's head like a vice. It wants nothing more than to destroy all that know of its existence.'\nBaking a Sugar and Spice Nectar Pie: The Deep\n_Find An Ancient Shrieker in The Deep at 855.38, 1186.24, -58.94. Kill it to loot Sunless Nectar. Combine this in an oven or spit with 1 x Spices + 1 x Pie Tin to craft Sugar and Spice Nectar Pie, trivial 176. The nectar is returned if you fail the combine._\nBaking an Aged Meat and Cheese Sandwich: Veksar\n_Find an \"ancient nobleman\" in Veksar at +95, -290. Kill it to loot an Aged Piece of Meat. Combine this in an oven or spit with 1 x Grilling Sauce + 1 x Loaf of Bread + 1 x Cheese to craft an Aged Meat and Cheese Sandwich **(trivial?)**._\nGive Treats to Kaiaren: Ocean of Tears\n_Head back to the Ocean of Tears and give the two treats to Kaiaren._\nKaiaren says 'Ah, thank you. These will help me greatly but I am afraid I will still lack the strength needed to combat this evil. You will have to go in my place until at least I have had a little longer to rest and train. If you [choose to continue], there are two more Disciples that you must face in order to reach the point of transcendence.'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'I choose to continue.'\nKaiaren says 'As I thought you would; you will find them as you did the others, in their natural essence. You will find the Disciple of Focus in the hills and mountains training diligently. The Disciple of Tranquility you shall find in a clearing where many do not travel without knowing valor and courage. It is there that you will be able to find your calmness. Please return to me when you have gained their respect as well as their symbols. I will also require your sash.'\nDisciple of Focus: The Tenebrous Mountains\n_Find the Disciple of Focus in the Tenebrous Mountains at -230, +900._\nYou say, 'Hail, Disciple of Focus'\nDisciple of Focus says 'I see you have finally come. I have sensed someone with the ability to confront the darkness before the Order coming. I know that this is you. Before you can continue I must know if this is the case. If so, you will [challenge] me.'\nYou say, 'I will challenge you.'\nDisciple of Focus says 'Prepare yourself then \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, for this will not be a battle you will want to lose.'\n_It respawns and attacks._\nDisciple of Focus says 'I wonder how much I could get for the tongue of a blithering fool..leave before I decide to find out for myself.'\n_Once it's dead **(fight info?)**:_\nDisciple of Focus's corpse says 'You have done well. May you continue to prosper through your trials.'\n_Loot a Symbol of Focus._\nDisciple of Tranquility: Plane of Valor\n_Find the Disciple of Tranquility in the Plane of Valor at +70, -1565._\nYou say, 'Hail, Disciple of Tranquility'\nDisciple of Tranquility says 'I see you bear the Sign of the Order. I already know why you are here, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. If it is my seal you wish to obtain you must [battle] me.'\nYou say, 'I wish to battle you.'\nDisciple of Tranquility says 'Prepare yourself then \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, for this will not be a battle you will want to lose.'\n_It respawns and attacks._\nDisciple of Tranquility says 'I didn't know Slime could speak common..go back to the sewer before I lose my temper.'\n_It hits for 1230 max and procs Blinding Essence of Purity and Strike of the Champion. Once it's dead:_\nDisciple of Tranquility's corpse says 'You have done well. May you continue to prosper through your trials.'\n_Loot a Symbol of Tranquility._\nBattle with Kaiaren: Ocean of Tears\n_Polish both symbols the way you did during epic 1.5 **(trivials? minimum skill required?)** to obtain a Polished Symbol of Focus and Polished Symbol of Tranquility. Head back to Kaiaren and hand both of these in along with your Initiate's Sash of the Celestial Order._\nKaiaren says 'I see you are ready to assume the [final task] before facing the Dark Foe that will forever change our way of life here.'\nYou say, 'What final task?'\nKaiaren says 'Yes, you must combat an enlightened one. It is our way that balance must be kept. Without good, evil cannot exist. We are but a small part in the cycle of true immortality. If you are [ready to begin] I will battle you. Please do not worry, if you defeat me, my being will continue to exist within you as that is the way of our Order. If you fall however, it was meant to be.'\nYou say, 'I am ready to begin.'\nKaiaren says 'Stand fast and ready to prove your worth now \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!'\n_He attacks. He hits for 2k, rampages, and procs Wave of Fury. Once he's dead:_\nKaiaren's corpse says, 'You have done very well.. You must now travel to the heart of the discord-filled lands and obtain an Globe of Discordant Energy. It is only after the menace has been stopped can we begin to live anew. If you succeed, return to Vortix. He will know what to do. Hurry for time is of the essence!'\n_\"a chest\" can spawn with additional loot._\nGlobe of Discordant Energy: Citadel of Anguish\n_The Globe of Discordant Energy drops after encounters with various raid mobs in Citadel of Anguish: Arch Magus Vangl, Jelvan`s Keepsake (spawns following successful completion of the tormentor ring), Orb of Discordant Energy (spawns after killing Warden Hanvar), Overlord Mata Muram._\nHand in the Globe: Plane of Tranquility\n_Head back to Vortix._\nYou say, 'Hail, Vortix'\nVortix says 'It is good to see you \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, but I have no new information to share with you. If you have anything to show me, please do.'\n_Give him the Globe of Discordant Energy and your Fistwraps of Celestial Discipline._\nVortix says 'By handing me this I already know of the events that have taken place this day. You must not be upset. Everything has balanced itself again. The Order has been restored and we must continue to train in the ways of the Enlightened. Take the globe back, and with the it and your Fistwraps of Celestial Discipline, please find Sebast Muckle in Plane of Knowledge and hand them to him. He is a great sage and will be able to know what to do with them to reward you properly.'\n_You get the globe and fistwraps back._\nYou Are Ready to Leave This Place: Plane of Knowledge\n_Find Sebast Muckle in the Plane of Knowledge at +25, +75, on the bottom floor of the building west and slightly south of the Crescent Reach portal._\nYou say, 'Hail, Sebast Muckle'\nSebast Muckle says 'Hello there. Can I be of service for anything?'\n_Hand in the globe and fistwraps._\nYou have gained an ability point! You now have XX ability points.\nSebast Muckle says 'I see you have found a way to bring order and balance back to the world. You should have also learned of the need for such evils in the world. There cannot be good without evil just as there cannot be truth without deception. I will take the discordant globe now with your fistwraps and make something wonderful for you from them. They will help guide you through the most difficult of times as a reminder of the knowledge you now possess for without the balance between good and evil we are but lost.'\n_You receive the Transcended Fistwraps of Immortality, a.k.a. monk epic 2.0. You also receive 10 AA points and access to your new title, Ascendant._\n- Transcended Fistwraps of Immortality [item=33043]",
